## 3. Production Approval Continuation Contract

```
Agent requests Tool Invocation A (run_tests with args X)
  ↓
ApprovalGate.check() → creates pending approval in DB
  ↓
Raises ApprovalRequired exception
  ↓
Runner catches → transitions to WAITING_APPROVAL
  ↓
Agent execution pauses（工具循环立即终止）
  ↓
External user approves via decide_approval(approval_id, "approved")
  ↓
Harness calls rt.run_turn(task_id=same_run_id)
  ↓
Runner detects approved but unexecuted approvals
  ↓
_execute_approved_invocation() runs original tool body with ORIGINAL args
  ↓
Records result into ExecutionEvidence
  ↓
Marks approval as executed (exactly-once)
  ↓
Continues model from tool result
```

**关键改变**：批准后不再依赖模型重新生成相同的 tool call。原始 invocation 被自动执行。

