```
RUNNING
  ↓ tool requests gated action
  ↓ ApprovalGate.check()
  ├─ approved in DB → execute tool → continue
  ├─ denied in DB → return DENY_TEXT → tool not executed
  └─ no record → create pending → raise ApprovalRequired
       ↓
WAITING_APPROVAL（runner 捕获异常，退出工具循环）
  ↓
  ├── approve → resume → auto-execute approved invocation → RUNNING
  ├── deny → bounded failure → FAILED
  └── no decision → remain WAITING_APPROVAL
```
